    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Japan, the Land of Cats in the Year 2200",
        "jpn": "2200年ねこの国ニッポン"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Takes place in the year 2200, where Japan has become a land of cats as the human population's birth rate has declined. In this future world, cats can talk, learn, and work. The story follows a high school girl and her argumentative cat.",
        "jpn": "舞台は西暦2200年。人間の出生率が低下した結果、日本は猫の国となっている。この未来世界では、猫たちは話し、学び、働く。物語は、ひとりの女子高生と彼女の理屈っぽい猫を描く。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "2200-nen Neko no Kuni Nippon"
    ],
